desc=First-person 3D time-trial campaign on Zan.Game.Render3D: six neon arena stages with ramps, platforms and pillars; static, rail, orbiting and pad-only targets; combo time bonuses, hidden shards, gold/silver/bronze medals and persisted bests; skybox, fog, shadows, bloom, tag VFX, progress ring, off-screen target markers and synthesized SFX.
desc.zh=基于 Zan.Game.Render3D 的第一人称 3D 计时赛战役：六关霓虹竞技场（坡道、平台、立柱），静止/导轨/环绕/踏台四类目标，连击减时、隐藏碎片、金银铜奖牌与最佳成绩存档；天空盒、雾、阴影、泛光、标记特效、进度环、屏外目标指示与程序化音效。
